This licence covers MintVID's own code only (player/core, player/amiga,
player/audio, player/iptv, player/youtube, and the GUI frontends). Several
vendored/pinned dependencies under player/vendor/ keep their own upstream
licences — notably libmpeg2 and the Rockbox/a52dec AC-3 core, which are
GPL-2.0-or-later and are statically linked into the mrplay binary, making a
distributed binary a combined work bound by GPL-2.0's obligations regardless
of this notice. See the Licensing section of README.md for the full
breakdown, and retain the licence notices under player/vendor/ when
redistributing source or binaries.
